From 772a675e2bf74b3007b6a852d70ee8a98e400d13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 06:50:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 132/144] Off-UI MayBlock folder enumerate (Exp 5)

Post upload-folder FileEnumerator to ThreadPool with MayBlock; finish
FileSelected on the UI thread. Fixes AssertBlockingAllowed abort on pick.
---
 .../ts_file_select_helper.cc                  | 121 ++++++++++++------
 .../ts_file_select_helper.h                   |   6 +-
 2 files changed, 88 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

